cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "avr8rs: a dependency-free native Rust AVR8 simulator core"
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
abstract: >-
  A native Rust implementation of an AVR8 (ATmega328P-class) microcontroller
  simulator: assembler, CPU and instruction decode, interrupts, clock, GPIO,
  megaAVR timers, ATtiny Timer1, EEPROM, ADC, SPI, USART, TWI master states and
  watchdog. It has no Cargo dependencies, embeds no JavaScript runtime, and is
  validated against the converted AVR8js behavioral test suite and against
  firmware compiled by arduino-cli for Arduino UNO boards.
type: software
authors:
